-gb/experiences/5368758349867888\n\nExplore a lovingly hand-crafted world full of swift carrots, weirdly aggressive tomatoes, and potatoes who are just trying their best. \n\nHelp a little turnip who works in an office!\nSupport a small business run by a carrot in a hat! \nDecorate a cute home to share with your favorite veggies!\n\nAnd never forget: you're surrounded by friends.\n\nJoin the Cookie Gardening Discord for updates: https://discord.gg/Stw3W2xHv3\n\n(Please note, there's currently no way to transfer your save file from the demo to the full version.)", "short_description": "Discover magical gardens. Throw cookies. Catch veggies."}]}, "developer_name": "Meep Engine", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://knipsch.com/cookieGardeningPrivacyPolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Meep Engine", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.meepengine.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1725996564472128"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["FOOD", "ARCADE", "SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "7088213034624701"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974534_1479561436196991_819995255387765739_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9ISe7cRJVkkQ7kNvwH7p5yp&_nc_oc=AdltWv41HD0FAexkBQmgF-mRKkzF5EEUUWjwuD7adKT7TdAX78qsvS7mIcpn22FefvE&_nc_zt=3&_